Here is the stuff I use to create a new mlmmj list.  I've been meaning to send 
this out for over a year, but never found time.  This isn't packaged nicely 
at all but I suspect it might be terribly useful to some.

Right now it needs editing to work outside of my host, but if people find it 
useful I'd be happy to make it more generic.  Patches would expedite that 
process, I'm pretty pressed for time lately.

The idea here is that the script sets up your directory the way you probably 
want it set up.  It uses m4 to substitute some list attributes into the 
control files that need them.  I like m4.

Warning: create a new directory before you untar this.  It'll untar into where 
everything lives relative to / on my box.

Neale


